# Per-(cluster, chrom) performance grid

**What this is.** One row per (cluster, chrom): the sample count
and resource usage that produced the cluster's popout estimate,
plus the cohort-aggregated mean CCC per comparison tool and the
pass-count over μ-evaluable RF labels (`#pass / #evaluable`).
Useful for spotting clusters where popout disagreed broadly with
every tool versus the clusters where most labels passed.

